msgid "If you are having difficulties using the action plan watch platform, please send an email to the administrators of the action plan.\n\nThank you for taking part in implementing the action plan!\n\nKind regards,\nthe action plan administrators"
msgstr "Hvis du har problemer med at bruge handlingsplanens overvågningsplatform, bedes du sende en e-mail til administratorerne af handlingsplanen.\n\nTak fordi du er med til at implementere handlingsplanen!\n\nMed venlig hilsen,\nhandlingsplanens administratorer"

